    "description_raw": "This spell clouds the mind of a humanoid creature with 4 or fewer Hit Dice so that it takes no actions. Humanoids of 5 or more HD are not affected. A dazed subject is not stunned, so attackers get no special advantage against it. After a creature has been dazed by this spell, it is immune to the effects of this spell for 1 minute. Daze, MassSource Ultimate Magic pg. 216\nSchool enchantment (compulsion) [mind-affecting]; Level arcanist 4, bard 4, inquisitor 4, medium 3, mesmerist 4, occultist 4, psychic 3, skald 4, sorcerer 4, summoner 4, summoner (unchained) 4, witch 4, wizard 4",
